<title>USA: Eastwind to repurchase up to 100,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Eastwind to repurchase up to 100,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CONSHOHOCKEN, Pa. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Eastwind Group Inc said it intends to repurchase up to 100,000 shares of Eastwind common stock on the open market or in negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Eastwind has approximately 2.2 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
